      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lovely 3 bedroom cottage located in mature area just off Trinity Street and Georges Street. Just a short walk to town centre, bus stop and all local amenities. Accommodation briefly comprises of; entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, ensuite and bathroom. Externally there is a front drive way and garden and to rear is a rear courtyard garden with fully decking. Upvc double glazed windows and gas fired central heating.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nEntrance Hall: 5.13 x 1.05\r\nlaminate wood floor\r\nSitting room: 3.49 x 3.98\r\nlaminate wood floor, display cabinet\r\nKitchen: 2.65 x 2.51\r\nfitted units, tiled floor, back door\r\nBedroom 1: 3.07 x 2.74\r\nlaminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 2: 2.69 x 3.04\r\nfitted wardrobe, laminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 3: 2.71 x 4.1\r\nlaminate wood floor, fitted wardrobe\r\nEnsuite: 1.53 x 1.91\r\ntoilet, whb, plumbed for washing machine\r\nBathroom: 2.13 x 1.82\r\nbath with electric shower, wc, whb, tiled\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1. Rear garden (fully decked)\r\n2. Side entrance \r\n3. front driveway & garden\r\n4. Gas fired central heating\r\n5. upvc double glazed windows\r\n6. composite front door"
